WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.732 --> 00:00:17.118
Danny: This place is Brad: It's school, Danny.

2
00:00:17.138 --> 00:00:18.619
Brad: We have to go.

3
00:00:18.639 --> 00:00:19.859
Tina: Yes.

4
00:00:20.379 --> 00:00:21.720
It's nice to be back.

5
00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:24.801
Danny: Remember what we were doing a week ago!

6
00:00:24.821 --> 00:00:28.323
Tina: Has it been only a week?

7
00:00:29.023 --> 00:00:31.404
Brad: It feels like a lifetime ago.

8
00:00:33.068 --> 00:00:35.389
Danny: Don't you want to go back to Ginormous?

9
00:00:35.409 --> 00:00:39.711
Tina: We already saved Ginormous.

10
00:00:40.551 --> 00:00:42.012
There's no reason to go back.

11
00:00:42.032 --> 00:00:45.613
Danny: We could have another adventure!

12
00:00:45.633 --> 00:00:48.434
Tina: We don't have any magic clay, Danny.

13
00:00:48.454 --> 00:00:50.095
Brad: She's right.

14
00:00:50.715 --> 00:00:52.556
And we have to go to school, anyway.

15
00:00:52.576 --> 00:01:01.879
Danny: I think Hopian would be happy to see us.

16
00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:03.000
Tina: Shh!

17
00:01:03.436 --> 00:01:05.677
Don't talk too loudly about our adventure.

18
00:01:05.697 --> 00:01:08.919
Brad: Yeah, no one would believe what we were saying.

19
00:01:08.939 --> 00:01:13.221
Mr. Smith: Children, please open your books to page fifty.

20
00:01:13.982 --> 00:01:23.207
Brad: Danny, why don't you play with me?

21
00:01:23.227 --> 00:01:26.969
Danny: Are you attacking evil giants on your computer?

22
00:01:26.989 --> 00:01:27.989
Brad: No.

23
00:01:28.189 --> 00:01:29.570
It's a new math program.

24
00:01:29.950 --> 00:01:33.132
I can calculate─ Danny: I'm not interested!

25
00:01:39.736 --> 00:01:40.196
Chuck: Ha.

26
00:01:40.817 --> 00:01:44.018
Your girlfriend is not playing with you anymore!

27
00:01:44.038 --> 00:01:46.259
Danny: She's not my girlfriend!

28
00:01:46.279 --> 00:01:48.080
Dave: He loves her!

29
00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:50.741
Brad: Listen, just leave us alone.

30
00:01:50.761 --> 00:01:56.964
Chuck: We could hurt you really bad.

31
00:01:56.984 --> 00:01:58.544
Danny: Don't try it.

32
00:01:59.245 --> 00:02:03.586
I've got a friend, a really big friend─ Brad: Danny!

33
00:02:03.667 --> 00:02:04.747
Don't say any more!

34
00:02:04.767 --> 00:02:06.588
Dave: No.

35
00:02:07.384 --> 00:02:09.745
I want to hear about your big friend.

36
00:02:09.765 --> 00:02:13.406
Tina: Will you two go away?

37
00:02:13.426 --> 00:02:15.967
Danny: Tina, I don't need your help.

38
00:02:16.807 --> 00:02:18.627
I'll get Hopian to punish them!

39
00:02:18.647 --> 00:02:19.688
Chuck: Who?

40
00:02:19.708 --> 00:02:23.349
Dave: He must have another girlfriend!

41
00:02:23.369 --> 00:02:25.529
Dave: "Hopian."

42
00:02:25.989 --> 00:02:27.690
What a stupid name!

43
00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:33.091
Chuck: I thought it would be "Peaches" or "Lovey Dovey!"

44
00:02:35.884 --> 00:02:36.184
Hoo, hoo, hoo!

45
00:02:36.224 --> 00:02:37.785
Danny: You'll be sorry you teased me!

46
00:02:37.805 --> 00:02:39.967
Dave: You can't hurt us.

47
00:02:40.728 --> 00:02:41.988
See ya, loser!

48
00:02:42.008 --> 00:02:48.513
Tina: Danny, we promised each other not to mention Hopian.

49
00:02:48.533 --> 00:02:50.855
Danny: Chuck and Dave are bullies!

50
00:02:51.856 --> 00:02:53.217
I wanted to scare them.

51
00:02:53.237 --> 00:02:56.159
Brad: I don't think that's a good idea.

52
00:02:56.179 --> 00:02:59.561
Danny: You're as dull as our teachers, Brad.

53
00:03:00.142 --> 00:03:01.963
Brad: I'm just cautious.

54
00:03:03.276 --> 00:03:06.597
Danny: You weren't cautious when we were trying to save Ginormous!

55
00:03:06.617 --> 00:03:09.379
Brad: We're back home now.

56
00:03:09.839 --> 00:03:10.839
Things are different.

57
00:03:11.019 --> 00:03:14.281
Danny: I don't care.

58
00:03:15.241 --> 00:03:17.262
I think everyone should know what we did.

59
00:03:17.282 --> 00:03:21.564
Tina: What is he doing?

60
00:03:22.284 --> 00:03:23.324
He hates soccer.

61
00:03:23.344 --> 00:03:26.706
Soccer player: Hey, you can't use your hands!

62
00:03:28.406 --> 00:03:30.667
Brad: I've got a bad feeling about this.
